# SendAndReceive Method

Sends request message(s), waits for and returns response message(s).

Applies to:{.prefix}

Client{.info}

~~~
R←X SendAndReceive Y
~~~

X is a Client, Y is one or more Requests, R is one or more Messages. The SendAndReceive method
establishes a connection, sends requests, receives results and closes the connection.

The argument is one or more Requests, and the result is one or more corresponding response
Messages.  It encapsulates all of the functionality of the Connect, Send, Receive and Close methods.

If the RequestTarget of a Request is not a simple character vector, a DOMAIN ERROR is signalled
before a connection to the server is opened.

